<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-011" chapter-id="c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-decree-context" source-id="s-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-decree-context-ws2288359">
  <p id="c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-decree-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">文安王皇后諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-decree-context:p001:m0006" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">寶明</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-decree-context:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-decree-context:p002:m0000" ref="w4m_9tw_147">明帝</persName>即位，出居鄱陽王故第，為宣德宮。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-decree-context:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">永元三年，<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangbaoming-decree-context:p003:m0005" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf">梁武帝</persName>定建鄴，迎入宮，后稱制。</p>
</text>
